<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **3.60	MATURITY  **18.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE     STEP-UP     ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S18.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **STEPS UP TO 4.54 PCT 18.JUL.97 IF NOT CALLED.</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
